      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.5,
          "end": 4,
          "en": "So let's now build this application together",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4,
          "end": 6.766,
          "en": "and let's solve this exercise together.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.766,
          "end": 10.3,
          "en": "By the way, if you were not able to do this on your own,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.3,
          "end": 11.666,
          "en": "that's no problem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.666,
          "end": 13.4,
          "en": "We're just getting started.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.4,
          "end": 15.766,
          "en": "It's the second application you're building.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.766,
          "end": 17.533,
          "en": "It's totally normal if you're not able",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 17.533,
          "end": 20.033,
          "en": "to complete it on your own yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 20.033,
          "end": 23.533,
          "en": "You'll get more practice throughout the rest of this course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 23.533,
          "end": 24.9,
          "en": "and you'll get plenty",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 24.9,
          "end": 27.333,
          "en": "of useful knowledge out of this section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 27.333,
          "end": 30.066,
          "en": "Let's simply build it together now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 30.066,
          "end": 34.466,
          "en": "And I wanna start with that first task here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 34.466,
          "end": 38.333,
          "en": "I wanna add that \"Header\" component to my application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.366,
          "end": 41.533,
          "en": "And therefore in the app folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 41.533,
          "end": 43.8,
          "en": "we can add a new header folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 43.8,
          "end": 46.533,
          "en": "where we can add those component files.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.7,
          "end": 50.933,
          "en": "Or alternatively, we don't do that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 50.933,
          "end": 53.366,
          "en": "And instead, in a new terminal window,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 53.366,
          "end": 57.966,
          "en": "we use the Angular CLI to add that header component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 57.966,
          "end": 61.433,
          "en": "With the ng, g, c command",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.433,
          "end": 64.633,
          "en": "to generate a new component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 64.633,
          "end": 66.4,
          "en": "and I'll name that component header",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 66.4,
          "end": 70.666,
          "en": "and I'll add the dash, dash, skip dash, tests flag",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 70.666,
          "end": 74.066,
          "en": "so that this extra testing file isn't generated,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.066,
          "end": 75.766,
          "en": "because I don't need that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 77.43299999999999,
          "end": 80.2,
          "en": "With that, I got my header folder here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 80.2,
          "end": 82.26599999999999,
          "en": "with the header.component files,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 82.26599999999999,
          "end": 84.233,
          "en": "and it automatically created",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 84.233,
          "end": 86.333,
          "en": "a standalone component for me here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 86.333,
          "end": 89.46600000000001,
          "en": "And I'll start by using standalone components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 89.46600000000001,
          "end": 91.93299999999999,
          "en": "but later at the end of this section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 91.93299999999999,
          "end": 95.566,
          "en": "I'll migrated all to module based components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 95.566,
          "end": 99.166,
          "en": "so that you also see how you could use modules instead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 99.166,
          "end": 101,
          "en": "of standalone components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 102.066,
          "end": 104.6,
          "en": "Now I will actually not change anything",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 104.6,
          "end": 106.533,
          "en": "in that header ts file though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 106.533,
          "end": 110.066,
          "en": "instead, I'll jump to the header.component.html file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 110.066,
          "end": 111.26599999999999,
          "en": "because it's in there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 111.26599999999999,
          "end": 116.26599999999999,
          "en": "where I now wanna add the header element like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 117.666,
          "end": 120.166,
          "en": "And then in there, I wanna have an h1 element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 120.166,
          "end": 124.533,
          "en": "where I say, Investment Calculator.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 124.533,
          "end": 127.733,
          "en": "And above that, I wanna have an image like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 128.7,
          "end": 129.966,
          "en": "And here for this source,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 129.966,
          "end": 132.333,
          "en": "it's now important to recognize",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 132.333,
          "end": 136.133,
          "en": "that the image is actually now in the public folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 136.133,
          "end": 139.766,
          "en": "It's this investment-calculator-logo.png file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 139.766,
          "end": 141.766,
          "en": "and you can actually just add it like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 141.766,
          "end": 145.8,
          "en": "and add the extension without adding public slash",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 145.8,
          "end": 146.8,
          "en": "at the beginning.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 146.8,
          "end": 150,
          "en": "And also not by adding assets slash at the beginning,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 150,
          "end": 152.1,
          "en": "because it isn't in an assets folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 152.1,
          "end": 154.666,
          "en": "And whilst it is in a public folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 154.666,
          "end": 157.066,
          "en": "this folder and the files inside of it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 157.066,
          "end": 159.53300000000002,
          "en": "are actually loaded slightly differently",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 159.53300000000002,
          "end": 163.3,
          "en": "so that you can and should omit the public path here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 163.3,
          "end": 165.8,
          "en": "and just directly reference the files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 165.8,
          "end": 168.666,
          "en": "and folders inside of the public folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 168.666,
          "end": 169.766,
          "en": "So in this case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 169.766,
          "end": 173.3,
          "en": "the image that's stored inside of the public folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 173.3,
          "end": 175.8,
          "en": "And then we should also add some alt text here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 175.8,
          "end": 176.633,
          "en": "like,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 177.966,
          "end": 179.1,
          "en": "money bag,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 179.1,
          "end": 182.133,
          "en": "because that's in the end what's visible on this image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 183.5,
          "end": 185.1,
          "en": "So that's the markup.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 185.1,
          "end": 187.2,
          "en": "We also need some styling,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 187.2,
          "end": 189.033,
          "en": "and that's why I attached",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 189.033,
          "end": 192.633,
          "en": "some components style files earlier in this section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 192.633,
          "end": 196.9,
          "en": "But attached U again finds the header.component.css file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 196.9,
          "end": 200.8,
          "en": "and you can simply replace your header.component.css file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 200.8,
          "end": 202.4,
          "en": "with the attached one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 204.633,
          "end": 205.833,
          "en": "Well, and with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 205.833,
          "end": 206.766,
          "en": "we got the markup,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 206.766,
          "end": 207.933,
          "en": "we got the styles,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 207.933,
          "end": 211.166,
          "en": "and we don't need any special TypeScript logic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 211.166,
          "end": 212.36599999999999,
          "en": "And we can, therefore,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 212.36599999999999,
          "end": 216.166,
          "en": "go back to the app.component.html file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 216.166,
          "end": 219.766,
          "en": "And in there, you can now replace this h1 element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 219.766,
          "end": 222.86599999999999,
          "en": "with app-header,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 222.86599999999999,
          "end": 226.1,
          "en": "and you can add that as a self-closing tag like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 227.133,
          "end": 228.36599999999999,
          "en": "though, as you see,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 228.36599999999999,
          "end": 229.633,
          "en": "this will give us an error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 229.633,
          "end": 231.36599999999999,
          "en": "that it's not a known element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 231.36599999999999,
          "end": 233.666,
          "en": "Because by default, as you learned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 233.666,
          "end": 238.666,
          "en": "Angular doesn't scan your project for possible components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 238.933,
          "end": 242.966,
          "en": "So in order to make Angular aware of a component here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 242.966,
          "end": 245.533,
          "en": "you have to add it to this imports array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 245.533,
          "end": 248.333,
          "en": "in the AppComponent TypeScript file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 248.333,
          "end": 250.966,
          "en": "So here, I'll add this imports array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 250.966,
          "end": 254.533,
          "en": "in my AppComponent component selector,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 254.533,
          "end": 259.233,
          "en": "and I will import the HeaderComponent",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 260.266,
          "end": 265.266,
          "en": "from ./header/header.component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 265.83299999999997,
          "end": 268.366,
          "en": "and then also add it here to imports.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 269.766,
          "end": 272.56600000000003,
          "en": "Alternatively, if I remove that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 272.56600000000003,
          "end": 276.6,
          "en": "we could, of course, also have used our IDE support",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 276.6,
          "end": 278.966,
          "en": "and we could have chosen that Quick Fix here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 278.966,
          "end": 281.666,
          "en": "which Visual Studio Code suggested to me.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 282.866,
          "end": 286,
          "en": "This also adds this import",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 286,
          "end": 288.633,
          "en": "and adds it here to this imports array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 290.033,
          "end": 293.766,
          "en": "And with that, if you go back to local host 4,200,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 293.766,
          "end": 297.1,
          "en": "you should now see your header here on the screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 297.1,
          "end": 299.533,
          "en": "the title and the image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 300.4,
          "end": 304.1,
          "en": "And that's the first step completed already,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 304.1,
          "end": 306.2,
          "en": "though, of course, arguably,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 306.2,
          "end": 308.833,
          "en": "the remaining steps will take up more time.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
